+and ∂α/∂t = v(α, t, r) = −(∂h/∂t)/(∂h/∂α + A) (3.25)–(3.26), p. 14. THE INEQUALITY AT THE CENTRE:
+
+  A_{Λ(n)}(α, r) ≥ A⁺_{Λ(n)}(α, r)   with r in (3.31)                                     (5.15), p. 26,
+  equivalently A_{Λ(n)}(α, r) ≥ A^(−)_{Λ(n)}(α, r)                                          (5.16), p. 26,
